# Modus Web Components 2.0 Architecture

## Framework

- **Stencil JS** web components (`modus-wc-*` tags)
- **Storybook** for docs and playground (port 6006)
- **Tailwind CSS + DaisyUI** for utility classes and theme tokens
- **SCSS** for component-specific overrides not covered by Tailwind/DaisyUI

## Commands

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `npm ci` | Install dependencies |
| `npm start` | Stencil watch + Storybook + lint |
| `npm run build:ci` | Stencil library build |
| `npm test` | Jest spec tests (100% coverage threshold) |
| `npm run lint` | ESLint + Prettier + Stylelint |
| `npm run tailwind:build` | Compile Tailwind output |
| `npm run embed:css` / `embed:component-css` | Embed CSS into components |

## Structure

```
src/
├── components/          # One directory per component (tsx, scss, spec, stories)
├── styles/              # Global CSS, themes, mixins, Tailwind config inputs
├── providers/           # Theme provider and shadow DOM helpers
└── icons/               # Inline SVG icon components
integrations/            # Optional React, Angular, Vue, Blazor, MAUI wrappers
```

## Theming

- Themes: `modus-modern-light/dark`, `modus-classic-light/dark`, `connect-light/dark`
- CSS variables in `src/styles/variables.css` and `modus-wc-variables.css`
- DaisyUI theme objects in `src/styles/themes/`
